t: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<hr style='white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);border-style: solid;border-right-width: 0px;border-bottom-width: 0px;border-left-width: 0px;border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.098);transform-origin: 0px 0px 0px;transform: scale(1, 0.5);visibility: visible;'/>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;\">\n          Yaye与我们之前售卖过的Rumudamo一样同样来自于Sidama，不同的是它来自于Arbigona镇，在Besna镇的西边相邻，隶属于Testi PLC。\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SIDRj7OdMiaO0ZWljx1IGj5D06jkE46BjicEKicQvOcAWxGarVKtL2eoZqu8YlsgsKKd45juzn3dAvQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;\">\n          Testi PLC是由Faysel Abdosh于2009年创立的，目前下属管理超过20个处理站，服务覆盖超过315公顷的咖啡种植基地，年出口超过1200个货柜的咖啡豆；像我们现在在售卖的圣塔维尼，邦比以及之前卖过的Adorsi和即将上架的Yaye和Hayissa都是Testi旗下的招牌产品。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7R2ZL2IQWptibaeWeAYGhNsLjNpNk69YKpHOoWKeMYsMFb0tzK5gAujDpZ3AOLsucjfD0GzcHajvzg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;\">\n          YAYE水洗站靠近天然水源，自然环境优越，而且运用了科学的管理方法：每个功能区划分得非常细致明确，他们会根据太阳照射的角度去规划、调整非洲床的位置。在阴凉处建立处理室，以创造一个低温发酵的环境。大部分晒床上方都设置遮阴棚，从而达到慢干燥处理的条件。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7R4xicpraSVYAHuNHia5LKCPqRuqdFFICGRhqIl6ID3bwXGeHhZCoB6lAElHBAxBxQKgcOaejLnChuw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          图片来源 朗巴赫\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          更多咖啡豆选购，请关注收藏小程序和淘宝店铺哦～\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;'>\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetic